WEBVTT

NOTE PayRoll Protect explainer. Transcribed locally (whisper.cpp base.en) and checked against the film.

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.630
An estimated £1.4 billion every year

2
00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.360
in the UK construction market

3
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.960
falls to fraudulent financial activity.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.280
PayRoll Protect is here to stop it,

5
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.350
by verifying 100% of your workforce, daily.

6
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.160
Because every subcontractor invoice is a claim.

7
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.328
Most are checked against paper registers

8
00:00:21.368 --> 00:00:24.068
and spreadsheets, if they’re checked at all.

9
00:00:24.108 --> 00:00:25.098
And at summary level,

10
00:00:25.138 --> 00:00:28.068
the numbers always look right.

11
00:00:28.108 --> 00:00:30.428
Ghost workers who never pass the gate.

12
00:00:30.468 --> 00:00:32.588
Hours that outrun the shift.

13
00:00:32.628 --> 00:00:34.868
One person clocking in for another.

14
00:00:34.908 --> 00:00:38.668
Each one hides inside a total that looks right.

15
00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:40.758
PayRoll Protect puts a face-scanning

16
00:00:40.798 --> 00:00:42.098
terminal at the gate.

17
00:00:42.138 --> 00:00:44.738
Every worker clocks in and out with their face.

18
00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:48.778
No cards, no apps, no proxy sign-ins.

19
00:00:48.818 --> 00:00:50.098
Setup is simple.

20
00:00:50.138 --> 00:00:51.718
The terminal arrives pre-configured

21
00:00:51.758 --> 00:00:53.498
and mounts at site entry.

22
00:00:53.538 --> 00:00:54.848
We install a Starlink dish

23
00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.508
so the gate never relies

24
00:00:56.548 --> 00:00:58.818
on site Wi-Fi or mobile signal.

25
00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:00.137
Workers enrol on their first day

26
00:01:00.177 --> 00:01:01.607
with nothing to download,

27
00:01:01.647 --> 00:01:04.927
and most sites are live within two weeks.

28
00:01:04.967 --> 00:01:06.357
And if the link ever drops,

29
00:01:06.397 --> 00:01:07.827
scans queue at the gate

30
00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:10.227
and sync the moment it’s back.

31
00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:12.567
Then every line of every labour invoice

32
00:01:12.607 --> 00:01:14.607
is matched against the gate record.

33
00:01:14.647 --> 00:01:16.277
Anything without a scan behind it

34
00:01:16.317 --> 00:01:19.916
is held for query before payroll runs.

35
00:01:19.956 --> 00:01:22.156
Verify, match, pay.

36
00:01:22.196 --> 00:01:23.516
PayRoll Protect.

37
00:01:23.556 --> 00:01:26.356
Don’t approve what you can’t prove.

38
00:01:26.396 --> 00:01:28.646
Book your 90-day pilot today.
